1
00:00:01,550 --> 00:00:02,962
My cabbages!

2
00:00:03,262 --> 00:00:07,339
Somebody robbed me, chat. And they left… fingerprints.

3
00:00:08,089 --> 00:00:09,435
Is this thing on?

4
00:00:10,935 --> 00:00:13,983
Hot. Too hot. …Perfect.

5
00:00:17,683 --> 00:00:21,688
Good morning, chat. Welcome to Grandpa's Block Lab.

6
00:00:22,588 --> 00:00:26,748
Not the boar, BoarFan. Look. Five little fingers…

7
00:00:26,748 --> 00:00:30,917
…like a tiny hand. A tiny, hungry hand.

8
00:00:32,917 --> 00:00:36,254
A raccoon. My crate got… ratioed.

9
00:00:36,654 --> 00:00:40,728
Wild animals: we look. We don't touch. And we never feed them.

10
00:00:42,528 --> 00:00:44,805
Ready, chat? Blocks up!

11
00:00:53,105 --> 00:00:55,365
Stone lid. Raccoon-proof.

12
00:00:58,965 --> 00:01:01,539
Nothing gets past Grandpa Tovi.
